## Notes for Presentation (Hidden Slide)

- **Timing**:
  - Allocate 2 minutes per slide.
  - Reserve 5 minutes for Q&A at the end.
- **Technical Setup**:
  - Ensure all A/V equipment is tested prior to the session.
  - Backup the presentation on a USB drive.
- **Engagement Tips**:
  - Use personal anecdotes to connect with the audience.
  - Pause for questions after Slide 3 and Slide 6.

